                                                                                                                                                                <div class="p-6 bg-turquoise-lighter mb-5">
                                                                              <h3 class="mb-4 font-medium text-20 text-silver">2026 Sustainability &amp; Responsible Sourcing Report: Now Live</h3>
                                                                            
                                                                              <div class="flex-1 text-20">
                                          <p>Highlighting the progress made across our Sustainability &amp; Responsible Sourcing Programme, setting out our 2027 priorities, and demonstrating how LBMA continues to promote integrity and trust in the market.</p>
                                        </div>
                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              <div class="pt-4">
                                                                                        <a class="cursor-pointer select-none rounded-sm px-4 py-2 uppercase shadow-md text-center flex font-medium text-20  text-white bg-turquoise hover:bg-turquoise-hover group-hover:bg-turquoise-hover transition-all duration-200" href="https://www.lbma.org.uk/articles/lbma-publishes-its-2026-sustainability-responsible-sourcing-report">
                                              Discover more
                                            </a>
                                          </div>
                                                                                                                  </div>
                                                                      <div class="p-6 bg-turquoise-lighter ">
                                                                              <h3 class="mb-4 font-medium text-20 text-silver">Responsible Gold Guidance V10: Public Consultation</h3>
                                                                            
                                                                              <div class="flex-1 text-20">
                                          <p>RGG10 draws on implementation experience since the introduction of V9, developments in responsible sourcing practice, and LBMA’s commitment to continuous improvement.</p>
