													<h1 class="mb-4 leading-none text-40 lg:text-60">LBMA <strong>Subscriber</strong></h1>

														<div class="max-w-4xl leading-tight text-24 md:text-28">
		<p>For organisations that want to keep up to speed with the market, becoming a Subscriber offers a range of benefits, including access to our information services.</p>
