<div class="container py-11 fade-in">
	<div class="row">
		<h2 class="text-40 md:text-50 leading-tight font-bold">Benefits</h2>					<div class="mb-10">
					<div class="max-w-4xl leading-tight text-24 md:text-28">
		<p>LBMA Subscriber is designed for organisations such as central banks, 
downstream multinationals, fintechs and others that want to keep up to 
date with the Loco London Precious Metals Market, but don’t necessarily 
have a direct, bullion-based relationship with its participants.</p>
	</div>

			</div>
		
															
