										<div class="container pt-5 pb-0 fade-in">
	<div class="row">
						<div class="max-w-2xl lg:w-10/12 mx-auto wysiwyg ">
						<h2>Categories and fees</h2>
		</div>
        	</div>
</div>
								
						
<!--<p class="pepper">layout/blocks/body/_text</p>-->


		<div class="container py-5 fade-in">
	<div class="row">
						<div class="max-w-2xl lg:w-10/12 mx-auto wysiwyg ">
						<h3>Subscriber Only<br /></h3>
<p>This category provides access to the Subscriber benefits outlined above, with more to follow.</p>
<h3>Good Delivery List (GDL) Licence Only</h3>
<p>A GDL Licence provides organisations with the right to reference the Good Delivery List and Rules or any proprietary information they contain. Licensees also have access to LBMA’s Visual Guide for Defects and Imperfections in Good Delivery Bars, a vital tool for any institution that stores gold or wishes to check on the bars that it owns. <a href="https://www.lbma.org.uk/good-delivery/gold-current-list">Find out more</a>.</p>
<h3>Combined Licence and Subscriber</h3>
<p>This combined offering includes the benefits of both Subscriber and the Good Delivery Licence.</p>
		</div>
        	</div>
</div>
								
						
	
<!--<p class="pepper">layout/blocks/body/_table</p>-->
<div class="container py-5 fade-in">
	<div class="row">
		<div class="max-w-2xl lg:w-10/12 mx-auto">
			<h2 class="mb-2 font-extrabold leading-6 text-24 md:text-29">Fees</h2>											<div class="wysiwyg">
					<p>The first annual fee is payable once your application is received. The subscription runs from 1 January to 31 December so fees will be adjusted pro-rata during the first subscription year. This subscription fee must be paid prior to the on-boarding process. The annual subscription fee may be subject to change. The fees for 2026 are:</p>
				</div>
																										
						    

        
                        <table class="border-collapse w-full relative">
                <thead class="">
                    <tr>
                                            <th class="p-2 text-left text-14 md:text-20 sticky top-0" align="left" width="">Classification</th>
                                            <th class="p-2 text-left text-14 md:text-20 sticky top-0" align="left" width="">Subscriber Fee</th>
                                            <th class="p-2 text-left text-14 md:text-20 sticky top-0" align="left" width="">GDL Licence Fee</th>
                                            <th class="p-2 text-left text-14 md:text-20 sticky top-0" align="left" width="">License + Subscriber Fee</th>
                                        </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                                    <tr class="bg-turquoise-lightest">
                                                    <td class="p-2 align-top" align="left">Global *</td>
                                                    <td class="p-2 align-top" align="left">£21,500</td>
                                                    <td class="p-2 align-top" align="left">£21,500</td>
                                                    <td class="p-2 align-top" align="left">£26,800</td>
                                            </tr>
                                    <tr class="">
                                                    <td class="p-2 align-top" align="left">Regional **</td>
                                                    <td class="p-2 align-top" align="left">£16,100</td>
                                                    <td class="p-2 align-top" align="left">£21,500</td>
                                                    <td class="p-2 align-top" align="left">£26,800</td>
                                            </tr>
                                    <tr class="bg-turquoise-lightest">
                                                    <td class="p-2 align-top" align="left">SME/Services ***</td>
                                                    <td class="p-2 align-top" align="left">£8,800</td>
                                                    <td class="p-2 align-top" align="left">£10,000</td>
                                                    <td class="p-2 align-top" align="left">£15,000</td>
                                            </tr>
